---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const stats = [
  { k: '178', zh: '个条目', en: 'entries' },
  { k: '244', zh: '个预览素材', en: 'preview assets' },
  { k: '59', zh: '段动态预览', en: 'motion clips' },
  { k: '9', zh: '个行业', en: 'industries' },
];
---

<Base title="关于本站" description="Code-2-Video-Lab 是什么、收录口径、许可说明。">
  <main class="wrap detail about">
    <a class="back" href="/">← 返回展厅</a>

    <div class="about-head">
      <h1>关于本站 <span class="about-en">About</span></h1>
      <div class="lang-switch" role="group" aria-label="语言">
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-lang="zh" aria-pressed="true">中文</button>
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-lang="en" aria-pressed="false">English</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="stats-row">
      {stats.map((s) => (
        <div class="stat">
          <strong>{s.k}</strong>
          <span class="zh">{s.zh}</span>
          <span class="en">{s.en}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </section>

    <article class="about-body" data-lang="zh">
      <h2>这是什么</h2>
      <p>Code-2-Video-Lab 是一个关于「代码生成画面」的展厅。它收集三类东西：能跑的工具与框架、真实做出来的作品、以及能算账的案例拆解。它不是视频生成产品，也不调用模型——是一个把散落在 GitHub、X、合集文档里的项目按统一口径整理好的内容站。</p>

      <h2>收录什么</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>项目</strong>：12 个开源代码视频工具与框架，看的是技术路线差异。</li>
        <li><strong>网页案例</strong>：100 个单文件 HTML 页面，展示代码直接产出视觉的边界，可在站内直接运行。</li>
        <li><strong>创作作品</strong>：31 个 AI 视频作品，附作者披露的制作细节与对比 Demo。</li>
        <li><strong>案例精读</strong>：24 个带成本、时长、token 口径的拆解，含证据缺口。</li>
        <li><strong>落地案例</strong>：10 个公司线上生产案例，公开源码、过程记录或账单。</li>
        <li><strong>研究报告</strong>：1 份交互式选型报告，含 TCO 测算与场景矩阵。</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>我们的口径</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>没跑过的项目写「未运行代码」，没操作过的案例写「未逐页运行交互」，不写实测结论。</li>
        <li>成本、时长、token 全部标明来源类型；作者没说清楚的，写「未说明」，不推测。</li>
        <li>代码许可与预览媒体使用依据分开登记，前者不推导后者。</li>
        <li>不做跨案例成本排名，因为任务不可比。</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>素材与许可</h2>
      <p>站点代码为 MIT。所有预览画面版权归原作者，本站仅作介绍性引用，已署名并回链原始来源；公开商用分发前需逐条向权利方确认。有一条案例的原帖已失效，页面上已标注。</p>

      <h2>继续看</h2>
      <p>完整说明在仓库的 <a href="https://github.com/MavCui/Code-2-Video-Lab#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">README</a>；为什么做这个站、设计上做了哪些取舍，在 <a href="https://github.com/MavCui/Code-2-Video-Lab/blob/main/docs/INTRO.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">项目介绍</a>。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="about-body" data-lang="en" hidden>
      <h2>What this is</h2>
      <p>Code-2-Video-Lab is a gallery for code-generated visuals. It collects runnable tools and frameworks, real finished work, and case studies that show the bill. It is not a video generation product and calls no model — it is a content site that normalizes projects scattered across GitHub, X, and shared documents onto one consistent basis.</p>

      <h2>What's inside</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Projects</strong> — 12 open-source code-video tools and frameworks, compared by technical route.</li>
        <li><strong>Web cases</strong> — 100 single-file HTML pages showing how far code alone can push visuals; each can be run in place.</li>
        <li><strong>Works</strong> — 31 AI-made videos with author-disclosed production details and comparison demos.</li>
        <li><strong>Case studies</strong> — 24 deep reads with cost, duration, and token accounting, including evidence gaps.</li>
        <li><strong>Production cases</strong> — 10 shipped company projects with source, process records, or bills.</li>
        <li><strong>Report</strong> — one interactive selection report with TCO modelling.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we write</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Projects we never ran say "code not run"; cases we never operated say "interactions not run page by page." No implied testing.</li>
        <li>Cost, duration, and token counts always carry their source type. What the author never stated is written as "not stated," never filled in.</li>
        <li>Code license and media usage basis are registered separately; the former never implies the latter.</li>
        <li>No cross-case cost ranking, because the tasks aren't comparable.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Media and license</h2>
      <p>Site code is MIT. All preview frames belong to their original authors and are used as introductory citation with attribution and a backlink; public commercial redistribution requires per-item confirmation. One case study's original post is gone, and the page says so.</p>

      <h2>Keep reading</h2>
      <p>Full documentation is in the repo's <a href="https://github.com/MavCui/Code-2-Video-Lab#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">README</a>; the reasoning and trade-offs are in the <a href="https://github.com/MavCui/Code-2-Video-Lab/blob/main/docs/INTRO.en.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">introduction</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var buttons = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.lang-switch .chip'));
  var bodies = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.about-body'));
  function setLang(lang) {
    buttons.forEach(function (b) { b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.dataset.lang === lang)); });
    bodies.forEach(function (a) { a.hidden = a.dataset.lang !== lang; });
    document.documentElement.lang = lang === 'en' ? 'en' : 'zh-CN';
    try { history.replaceState(null, '', lang === 'en' ? '/about/?lang=en' : '/about/'); } catch (e) {}
  }
  buttons.forEach(function (b) { b.addEventListener('click', function () { setLang(b.dataset.lang); }); });
  try {
    var p = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
    if (p.get('lang') === 'en') setLang('en');
  } catch (e) {}
})();
</script>
